Returns Management Service","description":"Amazon returns inspection, refurbishment, relisting, and liquidation. Recover value from returned inventory instead of writing it off.","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Ecom Circles"},"url":"https://ecomcircles.com/services/warehouse/returns-management/"}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Returns Management help me recover value?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We inspect, test, clean, and relist items that can be resold. Items that can't be resold are liquidated intelligently. Recovery varies by product category and condition."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What's your service fee?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"$3 per return, flat rate. No percentage of recovered value, no surprises. Whether you're processing 10 returns or 1,000, you know exactly what it costs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I redirect returns to your warehouse?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We provide a return address. Configure it in Amazon Seller Central's return settings. Returns ship automatically to us."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does inspection take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most items inspect within 1-2 business days. Full turnaround (inspect, refurbish, relist) is 5-7 days for resellable items."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What items can you refurbish?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Minor fixes only: cleaning, repackaging, battery replacement, simple cosmetic fixes. Major rebuilds aren't economical."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do relisted items have to be 'Used'?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, per Amazon policy. Refurbished items relist as \"Used - Like New\" or \"Used - Good\" depending on condition."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I see detailed return analytics?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Dashboard shows return reasons, refurbishment success rates, recovery per item, and trends over time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this available for Walmart returns?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Currently Amazon-focused. Walmart returns management coming Q3 2026."}}]}</script><section class="relative min-h-[600px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-r from-[#6366F1] to-[#EC4899] py-20 bg-shades"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl"><div class="text-center text-white" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold font-satoshi mb-6">Returns Management: Inspect, Refurbish &amp; Resell Your Amazon Returns</h1><p class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 opacity-90">Turn losses into inventory. We inspect, clean, test, and resell returned items instead of sending them straight to liquidation.</p><div class="flex gap-4 justify-center flex-wrap"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-[#6172F3] px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-neutral-100 transition" href="contact.php">Get Started<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/20 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white/30 transition border border-white/30" href="#pricing">See Pricing</a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 bg-shades"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl"><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">Amazon returns are a black hole for resellers. Customer buys product, returns it, you eat the cost. Most sellers throw them in liquidation bins and take 10-15 cents on the dollar. Ecom Circles Returns Management changes that. We receive your returns at our Chicago warehouse, inspect each item, determine if it&#x27;s refundable or resellable, clean and test what can be sold, and either relist it or liquidate intelligently. You get a report and credit. The math: recover meaningful value from returns instead of writing them off.</p></div></section><section class="py-16 bg-neutral-50 bg-shades"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#6172F3] mb-2">$3/return</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-1">Service</p><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Flat rate, no surprises</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#6172F3] mb-2">Inspect → Relist</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-1">Process</p><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Or liquidate intelligently</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#6172F3] mb-2">5-7 Days</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-1">Turnaround</p><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Inspection to resale</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-shades"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl"><div class="mb-12" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 font-satoshi mb-4">From Return to Resale</h2></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-inbox h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 12 16 12 14 15 10 15 8 12 2 12"></polyline><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Ship Returns to Warehouse</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Configure Amazon to send returns to our Chicago warehouse instead of liquidation bins. Live tracking in Ecom Circles software.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">We Inspect &amp; Test</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Each item gets: condition assessment, full functionality test, detailed photos, and categorization (resellable/parts/liquidation).</p></div><div class="flex flex-col" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Refurbish if Possible</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Minor fixes (cleaning, repackaging, battery replacement) that make items 100% resellable. We handle it. Major damage goes to liquidation.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-repeat h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m17 2 4 4-4 4"></path><path d="M3 11v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"></path><path d="m7 22-4-4 4-4"></path><path d="M21 13v1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Relist or Liquidate</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Refurbished items get relisted as &quot;Used - Like New&quot; or &quot;Used - Good&quot; on Amazon. Unsellable stock goes to bulk liquidation partners.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Get Paid</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">You get a detailed returns report, analytics on return reasons, and credit for recovered value. We handle all logistics.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-neutral-50 bg-shades"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl"><div class="mb-12" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 font-satoshi mb-4">Complete Returns Solution</h2></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 hover:border-[#6172F3] transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-inbox h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 12 16 12 14 15 10 15 8 12 2 12"></polyline><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Returns Intake</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Receive returns at our warehouse instead of Amazon liquidation. Automatically tracked and logged in Ecom Circles system.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 hover:border-[#6172F3] transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Inspection &amp; Testing</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Full condition assessment. Functionality testing. Detailed photos for each item. Documentation for your records.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 hover:border-[#6172F3] transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Refurbishment</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Minor repairs: cleaning, repackaging, battery replacement, simple fixes. Not full rebuild. Cost-effective improvements only.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 hover:border-[#6172F3] transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-repeat h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m17 2 4 4-4 4"></path><path d="M3 11v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"></path><path d="m7 22-4-4 4-4"></path><path d="M21 13v1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Relisting</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Refurbished items relisted as Used on Amazon with professional photos and accurate condition. Tracked in Ecom Circles inventory.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 hover:border-[#6172F3] transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Liquidation Optimization</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Unsellable inventory goes to qualified liquidation partners. We negotiate best-market prices, not bottom-dollar offers.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 hover:border-[#6172F3] transition" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Analytics &amp; Reporting</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Detailed reports: return reasons, refurbishment success rates, recovery value, and trends over time.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-shades" id="pricing"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl"><div class="mb-12" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 font-satoshi mb-4">Simple, Transparent Pricing</h2><p class="text-lg text-neutral-600 mb-8">Flat-rate returns processing. No percentage fees. No hidden charges.</p><div class="bg-neutral-50 p-8 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 mb-8"><p class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">$3 per return (flat rate)</p><p class="text-neutral-600 mb-4">100 returns in a month = $300. Simple.</p><ul class="space-y-2 text-neutral-600"><li><strong>Receiving/Intake:</strong> No charge (included)</li><li><strong>Inspection:</strong> No charge (included)</li><li><strong>Refurbishment:</strong> Minor repairs included; major rebuilds quoted separately</li></ul></div></div><div class="bg-[#6172F3]/5 border border-[#6172F3] rounded-lg p-8" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4 font-satoshi">How It Works</h3><div class="space-y-3 text-neutral-700"><p><strong>Without Returns Management:</strong> Returns go straight to liquidation bins at a fraction of their value.</p><p><strong>With Returns Management:</strong> Each return is inspected individually. Resellable items get cleaned, tested, and relisted. The rest is liquidated intelligently.</p><p class="pt-2 border-t border-[#6172F3]/20"><strong>The result:</strong> You recover value from returns that would otherwise be written off. $3 flat rate per return, no percentage of recovery.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-white bg-shades"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl"><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-8">Returns Management in Your Workflow</h2><div class="space-y-6 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed"><p>Returns management works best when connected to your order fulfillment. <a class="text-[#6172F3] font-semibold hover:underline" href="order-management.php">Manage all your orders</a> in one dashboard while we handle returns intake, inspection, and refurbishment in the background. As items are relisted, they sync back to your inventory.</p><p>For sellers using our <a class="text-[#6172F3] font-semibold hover:underline" href="warehouse.php">complete warehouse services</a>, returns management integrates seamlessly with your inbound stock, fulfillment, and inventory tracking. When a customer return arrives at our facility, it goes through our inspection and refurbishment process automatically, keeping your <a class="text-[#6172F3] font-semibold hover:underline" href="inventory-management.php">inventory levels accurate</a> in real time.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-neutral-50 bg-shades"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl"><div class="mb-12" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 font-satoshi">